    ok 2 - the report refuses an apples-to-oranges speedup ratio
    ok 3 - bounded service exchange is explicit
    ok 4 - should be equal
    1..4
ok 5 - three-way report compares correctness and transfer shape without a misleading speedup # time=0.483ms

# Subtest: PostgreSQL baseline fails closed on replica readiness and emits machine-parseable status SQL
